    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      176.13,
      204.17,
      387.56,
      229.31
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE FEDERATION OF PHOTOGRAPHICSOCIETIES OF SRI LANKA",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      245.57,
      401.88,
      325.91
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS a Federation called and known as the \u201cTheFederation of Photographic Societies of Sri Lanka\u201d hasheretofore been formed in Sri Lanka for the purpose ofeffectually carrying out its objects and transacting all mattersconnected with the said Federation according to the rulesagreed to by its members:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      342.17,
      401.9,
      408.71
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the said Federation has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was established, and has applied tobe incorporated and it will be expedient to grant the saidapplication:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      424.97,
      401.89,
      450.11
    ],
    "text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      466.37,
      401.86,
      505.31
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the The Federation ofPhotographic Societies of Sri Lanka (Incorporation) Act,No. of 2013.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      521.57,
      401.93,
      670.91
    ],
    "text": "2.From and after the date of commencement of thisAct, such and so many person as are now members of TheFederation of Photographic Societies of Sri Lanka (hereinafterreferred to as the \u201cFederation\u201d) or shall hereafter be admittedas members of the Corporation hereby constituted, shall bea body corporate with perpetual succession, under the nameand style of The \u201cFederation of Photographic Societies ofSri Lanka\u201d (hereinafter referred to as \u201cthe Corporation\u201d) andby that name may sue and be sued, with full power andauthority to have and use a common seal and to alter thesame at its pleasure.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      247.03,
      443.14,
      256.1
    ],
    "text": "Preamble.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      467.11,
      444.58,
      476.18
    ],
    "text": "Short title.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
