  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      202.85,
      397.17,
      225.95
    ],
    "text": "3.The general objects for which the Federation isconstituted are hereby declared to be\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      238.25,
      397.18,
      261.35
    ],
    "text": "(a)to popularize the art of photography as an artisticand technical media;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      273.65,
      397.2,
      320.39
    ],
    "text": "(b)to avail an oppoutunity in order to learn thephotographic art theoretically and practically freeof charge and to obtain any other professionalqualification in the field of photography;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      173.71,
      332.57,
      397.18,
      367.55
    ],
    "text": "(c)to facilitate the school students to learn thephotographic art free of charge as an aestheticsubject;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      379.85,
      397.17,
      414.71
    ],
    "text": "(d)to take action in order to keep the photographic artalive, and to safeguard the common rights of themembers of the societies;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      173.71,
      427.01,
      397.16,
      461.87
    ],
    "text": "(e)to publish any useful publication under thesponsorship of the federation with the view ofpromoting the field;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      175.15,
      474.17,
      397.18,
      497.27
    ],
    "text": "(f)to popularize the same among the photographicsocieties so established; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      509.57,
      397.21,
      579.95
    ],
    "text": "(g)to develope co-operation among the photographicsocieties internally and internationally in order toachieve the above objectivies; to educate how toprotect environment and to prepare for the future;and to develop co-operation and friendship amongthe societies.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      592.13,
      397.19,
      674.27
    ],
    "text": "4.(1) The management, control and administration ofthe Corporation shall, subject to the provision of this Act,and the rules in force for the time being of the Corporation,vested in a Board of Directors (hereinafter referred to as the\u201cBoard\u201d) consisting of the office bearers and such otherpersons as may be provided for in such rules and elected inaccordance therewith.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
