  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      202.85,
      401.89,
      237.71
    ],
    "text": "(2) The first Board of the Corporation shall consist of themembers of the Board of the Federation holding office onthe day preceding the date of commencement of this Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      250.01,
      401.9,
      379.31
    ],
    "text": "5.Subject to the provision of this Act and any otherwritten law, the Corporation shall have the power to do,perform and execute all such acts, matters and thingswhatsoever as are necessary or desirable for the furtheranceof its objects or any one of them, including the power toopen, operate and close bank accounts, to borrow or raisemoneys with or without security, to receive or collect grantsor donations, to invest its funds, to erect any builiding orstructure on any land held by the Corporation, and to engage,employ and dismiss officers and servants required for thecarrying out of the objects of the Corporation.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      391.61,
      401.91,
      450.11
    ],
    "text": "6. (1) It shall be lawful for the Corporation, from time totime, at any general meeting and by the votes of not lessthan two thirds of the members present and voting, to makerules, not inconsistence with the provision of this Act or anyother written law, for all or any of the following matters:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      462.41,
      401.89,
      509.15
    ],
    "text": "(a)the classification of membership, fees payable byeach class of members and admission, withdrawal,expulsion or resignation of members and for themaintaining of register of members;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      521.33,
      401.86,
      556.31
    ],
    "text": "(b)the election of office bearers of the Board orvacation of or removal from, office and the powers,duties and functions of the office bearers;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      178.29,
      568.61,
      401.87,
      603.47
    ],
    "text": "(c)the appointment, powers, duties and functions andconditions of the various officers, agents andservants of the Corporation;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      615.77,
