    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      406.97,
      401.89,
      466.31
    ],
    "text": "11.The main objective of the federation is to give duerecognition to the photographers as professionals whileaccepting all other aesthetics as professions withinSri Lankan territory. They shall comply to the code of ethicsto be followed by the professionals.",
